    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create a flowchart to model the scenario.\r\n\r\n2. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Heart Button\r\n\r\n- If the user favorites an item, fill the heart with color and add one to the \"favorites\" count.\r\n- If the user un-favorites an item, change the heart to an outline and remove the fill.",
